<title>USA: Patriot American acquires three hotels.</title>
<headline>Patriot American acquires three hotels.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Patriot American Hospitality Inc said it had completed the acquisition of three full-service hotels in Miami, Chicago and Tallahassee markets for a total of $32.1 million.</p>
<p>It said Doubletree Hotels Corp would take over management of the hotels through one of its subsidiaries.</p>
<p>Doubletree is an hotel management company, while Patriot is a real estate investment trust.</p>
</text>
